					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I always found parallax funny; not because of what it does, but because for some reason people feel compelled to name badass characters after it. Why? Sure, it sounds cool, but parallax is just how objects appear to move depending on the eye through which they're observed. Why name dragons and space aliens after it? Is the new villain in the James Bond movie going to be named Meniscus?<br /> Anyway, this made me laugh more than once, so +1 for you.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
