					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-555036#post-1555991</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-555036/scp-042-j#post-1555991</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 04 Sep 2012 18:25:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ChazzK</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1203158</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Who the hell promoted this man? He's not even a real doctor. -O5-█</p> </blockquote> <p>The exact moment I upvoted.</p> <p>Also, I get hit with this constantly, and not just pillows. My right eye is 20/20, my left eye has an astigmatism and thus it's hard to focus properly (combined with a minute case of lazy eye that only manifests when I'm very tired..) Basically, anything less than about a foot and a half from my face gets a little ghost alongside of it until it focuses in properly, and right up to my face I'm always seeing double. &quot;No Chazz, you are the SCP.&quot; And then a skeleton jumped out.</p> <p>So yes, a J that both makes me laugh (the lolfoundation, not the subject matter itself) and hits close to home. Definite +1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
